{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beatfinder is a fast, simple-to-pick-up rhythm runner.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll jump, slide, and kick your way across rooftops, dodging obstacles and knocking out cultists, all while staying in sync with the music. Each track is its own handcrafted level. Every jump and punch timed just right to keep you in the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/1.gif?t=1745859317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Punch </strong>enemies that stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/4.gif?t=1745859317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slide</strong> under obstacles with style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/2.gif?t=1745859317\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Jump </strong>from rooftop to rooftop\u00a0and beat the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><br><br>Simple controls and tough timing<br>but when it clicks, it feels <i>amazing</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537980?t=1745859317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537980?t=1745859317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/c5edf44d7a8ba14dd26b9ebcc2eea62fc4ebfb18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745859317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams